  "title": "Unusual Happenings At Paradise",
  "subtitle": "",
  "description": "\"There are things here. Very old things. They live in the forests. They live in the caves. They live in the water. I’ve… I’ve never seen…I didn’t think they were real. Just stories, bedtime stories to keep kids out of the forests at night and to listen to their parents.\" Sisters Amy and Heather knew better than to drive through the winding old backroads through the forest on their way home. And yet they find themselves stranded in the middle of the forest with hours of moonlight remaining. Can they survive the night? Unusual Happenings At Paradise is a horror audio drama podcast.",
